# INGF-02, mirroring INGF-01 / CRPS-01 / CRPS-03. Keep LF in the working tree (core.autocrlf=true
# would otherwise rewrite these on a Windows checkout).
* text eol=lf
# ...but the decompression-bomb fixtures are gzip streams whose SHA-256 the suite pins. A text
# rewrite would corrupt them on a Windows checkout, so mark them binary AFTER the text rule — the
# last matching rule wins (the CRPS-08 lesson).
fixtures/bombs/*.gz binary
fixtures/bombs/*.bin binary
